<PageLayout title="Affiliate disclosure" description="How Stay Prepped may earn money from links, and how that is kept separate from our advice." updated={new Date('2026-10-24')}>
  <p><strong>At the moment, Stay Prepped has no affiliate links and earns no commission from any product.</strong></p>
  <p>In the future, we may join affiliate programmes. This means that if you click a link to a retailer and buy something, we might earn a small commission at no extra cost to you.</p>
  <h2>Our promises</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Any page containing affiliate links will say so clearly, near the top of the page.</li>
    <li>Commission will never decide what we recommend. Our buying guides explain what to look for so you can judge for yourself.</li>
    <li>We will not claim to have tested a product unless we have, and we will not publish fake reviews or ratings.</li>
    <li>Our tools will always be free.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>This approach follows the principle in UK advertising rules that marketing must be obviously identifiable. If you have a question about this, please <a href="/contact/">contact us</a>.</p>
</PageLayout>
